age.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dNu7B7u33j89T7Jve0jIAPurnYA.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-11-14\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Martha Throws An Argentine Asado BBQ\",\"overview\":\"Martha is throwing a very special BBQ called Asado; plus Martha prepares a chimichurri sauce, her daughter Alexis's chopped salad and for dessert, fruit flavored popsicles; a perfect celebration.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zrHnIM7p9rHQmCaVxBZJYZdSflt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-14\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"The Perfect Jams to Pair With a Simple Breakfast\",\"overview\":\"One of Martha's favorite things to do is to make jam with the perfectly ripened fruit and berries grown on her Bedford farm; Martha shares her favorite recipes, as well as jam and jarring techniques.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9NBE50d8SO4aVjvy3fFpva1Imtt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-14\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"How to Properly Cook an Egg\",\"overview\":\"Meet Martha in one of her favorite places on the farm - the chicken coop to talk about one of her favorite things to eat - eggs; Martha will share her top methods for making an egg-cellent breakfast.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zFmz6rGGyIrgAXsFWjgCYmE1Ets.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-21\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Pasta Night\",\"overview\":\"Tonight is pasta night in Bedford; Martha and friends make three pasta dishes, including a recipe from her new restaurant, The Bedford, a no-knife spaghetti, and a lemon angel hair pasta.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wwC75hLWctYjMPU7eCBeVrbnZMv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-21\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Shellfish\",\"overview\":\"Martha takes shellfish to the next level with sustainable oysters, baked stuffed clams and more.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r6XQYqcTfJSa3GMslQGujwtsfyH.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-28\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Steak Night\",\"overview\":\"From a pan seared steak with bordelaise sauce to a classic sizzling steak fired up on the grill, Martha makes steak dinners cooked to perfection with the help of her Head of Culinary at the farm.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wxQE1uT3iCfdKXxuLqFyCfeScRq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-28\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"A Classic French Dish: Pot Au Feu\",\"overview\":\"Martha prepares pot-au-feu, a hearty french dish of root vegetables and various cuts of meat, all braised in a savory broth; It's served with sliced meat, vegetables and delicious accompaniments!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/awZXvi4qIwmWbL7YByD7EAGS9As.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-05\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Paella on an Open Fire\",\"overview\":\"Martha creates the perfect menu for a paella party that will have your guests coming back for seconds; her paella is served with gazpacho and her incredible sangria.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1zbzaCBGvShFu8aXWp6mYFJTOLv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-05\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Vietnamese Cuisine\",\"overview\":\"Martha's friend Monica Tran joins to make traditional Vietnamese cuisine. Golden fried spring rolls, chicken pho soup, and sizzling pancakes complete the incredible Vietnamese feast.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-12\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Sweet and Savory Apple Dishes\",\"overview\":\"So many apples and so many delicious recipes to make with them. Martha is making homemade apple cider, a cider-bourbon cocktail, tender pork roast with apples, and an apple brioche bread pudding.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-19\",\"runtime\":25}],\"firstAi